GC_LobbyGameMode : "{A79C4E0A43DEB821}Prefabs/MP/Modes/GC_LobbyGameMode.et" {
 ID "3C0C1742186CA9AD"
 components {
  GC_LobbyManager "{6A137A39106A4973}" {
   m_aBriefings {
    GC_Briefing "{D2438074BF118FED}" {
     m_iOrder 0
     m_sTitle "Overview"
     m_sContent "2:1 UK:IRA, fill CIV last"\
     ""\
     "60 minute TL after 10 minute setup, IGB preferred"\
     ""\
     "Late in the troubles, British sections patrol several locations in rural Northern Ireland while the IRA prepares to interdict them."\
     ""\
     "Can be run as a straight TVT without Civs if under 30 players."
    }
    GC_Briefing "{F147BA86BB56E112}" {
     m_iOrder 1
     m_sTitle "I. Situation"
     m_sContent "IRA activity has been high around the small town of Le Moule, with sniper and bomb attacks taking place against British forces."\
     ""\
     "Your unit has been tasked with a patrol in force through the area to reduce the IRA's control over the area, draw them out in force, and attempt to locate their safehouse in the area."\
     ""\
     "Civilians are present in the area, so we should approach the area cautiously."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{E0743610F1DC188A}" {
     m_iOrder 2
     m_sTitle "II. Friendly Forces"
     m_sContent "2x Sections + HQ element of British Light Infantry."\
     ""\
     "Wearing DPM, equipped with L85s and Combat Body Armour."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{6A2E577227BEDE4D}" {
     m_iOrder 3
     m_sTitle "III. Enemy Forces"
     m_sContent "Unknown size IRA element."\
     ""\
     "Expected to be wearing a mixture of civilian clothes, DPM and olive drab."\
     ""\
     "Equipped with a variety of weapons including M16s, AKs and SLRs."\
     ""\
     "This element has been responsible for sniper and bomb attacks in the area, be cautious of both risks."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{860DCC41B8CE3BD7}" {
     m_iOrder 4
     m_sTitle "IV. Mission"
     m_sContent "Patrol through the 4 marked areas, then extract to either the eastern or western extraction points marked on the map. Patrolling 3 will be acceptable for a minor victory. You have 60 minutes after setup to accomplish this."\
     ""\
     "Maintain security in an objective area for 30 seconds without any IRA present for it to be considered patrolled. Civilians presence does not need to be cleared from an area."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{7E08E10FF4C52B3D}" {
     m_iOrder 5
     m_sTitle "I. Situation"
     m_sContent "We have had success harrassing the British around the small town of Le Moule, with sniper and bomb attacks having good effect."\
     ""\
     "A contact of ours spotted a sizeable British force mustering to the north of Le Moule, and we expect they will conduct a patrol in force through the area shortly."\
     ""\
     "This is a good opportunity to for us conduct an ambush or harrass them further."\
     ""\
     "Civilians are present in the area, so we should take this into consideration for our plans."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_IRA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{B22F5F683C1214C8}" {
     m_iOrder 6
     m_sTitle "II. Friendly Forces"
     m_sContent "10 pax maximum IRA element."\
     ""\
     "Wearing a mixture of civilian clothes, DPM and olive drab."\
     ""\
     "Equipped with a variety of weapons including M16s, AKs and SLRs."\
     ""\
     "We have a marksman and a sapper capable of conducting sniper and bomb attacks."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_IRA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{83F35480F3D35DBD}" {
     m_iOrder 7
     m_sTitle "III. Enemy Forces"
     m_sContent "2x Sections + HQ element of British Light Infantry."\
     ""\
     "Wearing DPM, equipped with L85s and Combat Body Armour."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_IRA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{6DBDBDAA85AA7EE3}" {
     m_iOrder 8
     m_sTitle "IV. Mission"
     m_sContent "Prevent the British from completing their patrol through the 4 marked areas on the map. They may be satisfied with 3 out of the 4 areas, so don't put all your eggs in one basket. Delaying them for 60 minutes after setup will also be a victory."\
     ""\
     "Inflict 75% casualties on the British forces or force them to withdraw early for this to be considered a win."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_IRA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{66FD3BB43CC12E0C}" {
     m_iOrder 9
     m_sTitle "V. Service & Support"
     m_sContent "We have a 4 seater jeep and a large truck capable of fitting all of us at our current location."\
     ""\
     "There is a crate with some extra radios and binoculars at our current location, we could distribute these to sympathetic civilians to get some spotters on our side."\
     ""\
     "There are also various civilian vehicles in the area which we could try to commandeer from the locals, and make use of for either transport or car bomb attacks."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_IRA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{279C18C7B798215D}" {
     m_iOrder 10
     m_sTitle "V. Rules of Engagement"
     m_sContent "Do not engage anyone unless they are clearly armed or taking hostile action which could endager the lives of British service members."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "UK"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{20545124C2533328}" {
     m_iOrder 11
     m_sTitle "VI. Rules of Engagement"
     m_sContent "Do not engage civilians unless they are clearly armed or taking hostile action which could endager the lives of IRA members."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "GC_IRA"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{D31CBCF2C9EC84B2}" {
     m_iOrder 12
     m_sTitle "I. Situation"
     m_sContent "It's a lovely day in County Le Moule, despite the violence that has been taking place recently."\
     ""\
     "The British are patrolling the area, while the IRA have been attacking them regularly. Hopefully today doesn't see more of this chaos."\
     ""\
     "We're currently out for a stroll in Le Moule itself."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "CIV"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{043603B6A6CED072}" {
     m_iOrder 13
     m_sTitle "II. Mission"
     m_sContent "Decide where your individual loyalties lie, if you're a protestant supporting the crown or a catholic sympathetic to the IRA."\
     ""\
     "Help or hinder whichever faction you decide, and adjust your behaviour based on the actions of the British or the IRA."\
     ""\
     "You could borrow an IRA radio and binoculars and act as a spotter for them, or seek out the Brits and feed them either accurate or false information about the IRA depending what mood strikes you."\
     ""\
     "If you pick up a weapon or take hostile action against a faction don't be surprised if you are then gunned down."\
     ""\
     "Lean into the roleplay, have fun and make it fun for the UK/IRA players as well, and don't get too salty."
     m_aFactionKeys {
      "CIV"
     }
    }
    GC_Briefing "{F18B6EF1D6BA910B}" {
     m_iOrder 14
     m_sTitle "Mission Notes"
     m_sContent "Mission by arc"\
     ""\
     "10 minute setup, IRA can go around the AO during this time but not towards Brit spawn. No AO limit after setup."\
     ""\
     "Positions are 30 second capzones for UK, requiring no IRA presence. They remain capped once done for the first time."\
     ""\
     "End conditions:"\
     "All 4 positions patrolled and 75% UK extraction, or 90% IRA casualties - UK Major Victory"\
     "3/4 positions patrolled and 75% UK extraction - UK Minor Victory"\
     "75% UK extraction before hitting 3 positions patrolled - IRA Minor Victory"\
     "75% UK casualties - IRA Major Victory"\
     ""\
     "MM Intent:"\
     "Civs are not to be purposely engaged by either team unless obviously armed or taking overtly hostile actions."\
     ""\
     "Brits should elect to withdraw early to reduce the IRA victory if appropriate based on resistance and casualties."
    }
   }
  }
 }
}
